<title>VIETNAM: Vietnam to auction 100 billion dong in T-notes.</title>
<headline>Vietnam to auction 100 billion dong in T-notes.</headline>
<dateline>HANOI 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vietnam will auction 100 billion dong ($9.075 million) worth of one-year treasury notes on Wednesday, an official at the State Bank said.</p>
<p>At the last auction of government paper, on August 14, the Bank issued 100 billion dong worth of one-year notes at a rate of 8.30 percent.</p>
<p>Further details were not available on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
